==How to Acquire==

To make a Ceramic Knife, you need to fire an [[Unfired Ceramic Knife]] in a [[Kiln]]:

*Use the craft menu to mold the clay, and then fire the unburnt [[{{PAGENAME}}]] in a [[Kiln]] with 12 branches loaded.
*After 54 minutes you will get a Ceramic Knife.